{
  "kind": "Dashboard",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "overview",
    "project": "dcu-monitoring"
  },
  "spec": {
    "display": {
      "name": "运行概览",
      "description": "数据源：test4 VictoriaMetrics。缺失或无效观测留空；默认 1 小时 / 15 秒刷新。"
    },
    "duration": "1h",
    "refreshInterval": "15s",
    "variables": [
      {
        "kind": "ListVariable",
        "spec": {
          "name": "role",
          "display": {
            "name": "角色"
          },
          "defaultValue": ".*",
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "StaticListVariable",
            "spec": {
              "values": [
                {
                  "value": ".*",
                  "label": "全部"
                },
                {
                  "value": "prefill",
                  "label": "Prefill / dcu1"
                },
                {
                  "value": "decode",
                  "label": "Decode / dcu2"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "panels": {
      "p0": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "采集目标状态",
            "description": "指标含义\nPrometheus 采集目标的抓取状态：1 表示本次指标抓取成功，0 表示失败。图例区分采集 job；采集成功只证明监控端点可读取，不证明模型能够正常完成推理。\n\nY 轴单位\n状态值；1 = 本次采集成功，0 = 本次采集失败。\n\n曲线与范围\nDCU 环境。图例区分节点、角色、实例、设备或统计分位数；筛选器仅改变所选序列，不自动生成集群去重汇总。\n\n时间口径\n容量、队列和状态表示观测时刻值；服务请求/Token 速率由源监控按连续采样间隔计算。 当前看板默认最近 1 小时、15 秒刷新；X 轴为时间。刷新间隔与统计窗口是不同概念。\n\n零值与空白\n缺样、过期或有效性检查不通过时留空。No data 不等于零；正常有效的零值才表示测得为零。"
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "TimeSeriesChart",
            "spec": {
              "legend": {
                "position": "bottom",
                "mode": "list"
              },
              "yAxis": {
                "label": "1 = 正常",
                "min": 0
              },
              "visual": {
                "display": "line",
                "lineWidth": 1,
                "connectNulls": false
              },
              "tooltip": {
                "enablePinning": true
              }
            }
          },
          "queries": [
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": "up{environment=\"dcu-pd\"} and (time() - timestamp(up{environment=\"dcu-pd\"}) < 15)",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{job}}",
                    "minStep": "5s"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "p1": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "推理请求速率",
            "description": "指标含义\n源服务请求累计计数（sglang:num_requests_total）在连续采样间隔内的平均增长速率。按节点/角色展示；不等于成功请求吞吐，也不等于网关到达速率。同一请求可能经过 P/D 两侧，不能把两侧直接相加当作去重请求量。\n\nY 轴单位\n请求 / 秒；表示每秒的平均变化量。\n\n曲线与范围\nDCU 环境。图例区分节点、角色、实例、设备或统计分位数；筛选器仅改变所选序列，不自动生成集群去重汇总。\n\n时间口径\n容量、队列和状态表示观测时刻值；服务请求/Token 速率由源监控按连续采样间隔计算。 当前看板默认最近 1 小时、15 秒刷新；X 轴为时间。刷新间隔与统计窗口是不同概念。\n\n零值与空白\n缺样、过期或有效性检查不通过时留空。No data 不等于零；正常有效的零值才表示测得为零。 派生指标须满足 monitoring_chart_valid=1；原始数值存在但标记无效时也不显示。"
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "TimeSeriesChart",
            "spec": {
              "legend": {
                "position": "bottom",
                "mode": "list"
              },
              "yAxis": {
                "label": "请求 / 秒",
                "min": 0
              },
              "visual": {
                "display": "line",
                "lineWidth": 1,
                "connectNulls": false
              },
              "tooltip": {
                "enablePinning": true
              }
            }
          },
          "queries": [
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": "(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.requests\"} and (monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.requests\"} == 1) and (min_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.requests\"}[$__interval]) == 1) and (count_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.requests\"}[$__interval]) >= ($__interval / 5)) and (time() - timestamp(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.requests\"}) < 15)) * 1",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{path}}",
                    "minStep": "5s"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "p2": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "输出 Token 吞吐",
            "description": "指标含义\n服务侧 Token 计数在连续采集间隔内的平均增长速率，按节点/角色展示。Token 是分词器单位，不等同于字符数或请求数；不同模型或输入输出组成的吞吐不宜直接比较。输出 Token 与 Decode Token 遵循各自源指标，源无效时留空。\n\nY 轴单位\nToken / 秒；表示每秒的平均变化量。\n\n曲线与范围\nDCU 环境。图例区分节点、角色、实例、设备或统计分位数；筛选器仅改变所选序列，不自动生成集群去重汇总。\n\n时间口径\n容量、队列和状态表示观测时刻值；服务请求/Token 速率由源监控按连续采样间隔计算。 当前看板默认最近 1 小时、15 秒刷新；X 轴为时间。刷新间隔与统计窗口是不同概念。\n\n零值与空白\n缺样、过期或有效性检查不通过时留空。No data 不等于零；正常有效的零值才表示测得为零。 派生指标须满足 monitoring_chart_valid=1；原始数值存在但标记无效时也不显示。"
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "TimeSeriesChart",
            "spec": {
              "legend": {
                "position": "bottom",
                "mode": "list"
              },
              "yAxis": {
                "label": "Token / 秒",
                "min": 0
              },
              "visual": {
                "display": "line",
                "lineWidth": 1,
                "connectNulls": false
              },
              "tooltip": {
                "enablePinning": true
              }
            }
          },
          "queries": [
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": "(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.output_tokens\"} and (monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.output_tokens\"} == 1) and (min_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.output_tokens\"}[$__interval]) == 1) and (count_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.output_tokens\"}[$__interval]) >= ($__interval / 5)) and (time() - timestamp(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.output_tokens\"}) < 15)) * 1",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{path}}",
                    "minStep": "5s"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "p3": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "Decode Token 吞吐",
            "description": "指标含义\n服务侧 Token 计数在连续采集间隔内的平均增长速率，按节点/角色展示。Token 是分词器单位，不等同于字符数或请求数；不同模型或输入输出组成的吞吐不宜直接比较。输出 Token 与 Decode Token 遵循各自源指标，源无效时留空。\n\nY 轴单位\nToken / 秒；表示每秒的平均变化量。\n\n曲线与范围\nDCU 环境。图例区分节点、角色、实例、设备或统计分位数；筛选器仅改变所选序列，不自动生成集群去重汇总。\n\n时间口径\n容量、队列和状态表示观测时刻值；服务请求/Token 速率由源监控按连续采样间隔计算。 当前看板默认最近 1 小时、15 秒刷新；X 轴为时间。刷新间隔与统计窗口是不同概念。\n\n零值与空白\n缺样、过期或有效性检查不通过时留空。No data 不等于零；正常有效的零值才表示测得为零。 派生指标须满足 monitoring_chart_valid=1；原始数值存在但标记无效时也不显示。"
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "TimeSeriesChart",
            "spec": {
              "legend": {
                "position": "bottom",
                "mode": "list"
              },
              "yAxis": {
                "label": "Token / 秒",
                "min": 0
              },
              "visual": {
                "display": "line",
                "lineWidth": 1,
                "connectNulls": false
              },
              "tooltip": {
                "enablePinning": true
              }
            }
          },
          "queries": [
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": "(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.decode_tokens\"} and (monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.decode_tokens\"} == 1) and (min_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.decode_tokens\"}[$__interval]) == 1) and (count_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.decode_tokens\"}[$__interval]) >= ($__interval / 5)) and (time() - timestamp(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.decode_tokens\"}) < 15)) * 1",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{path}}",
                    "minStep": "5s"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "p4": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "首 Token 延迟 TTFT",
            "description": "指标含义\n服务侧从请求开始到首 Token 的时延。它不等于客户端看到首字符的完整网络时延，也不同于当前仍在等待请求的最大年龄。 P50/P95/P99 是窗口内样本分位数，例如 P95 表示约 95% 的观测不超过该值。分位数来自直方图桶估算，不是精确逐请求排序；不能直接平均多节点的分位数。\n\nY 轴单位\n秒。\n\n曲线与范围\nDCU 环境。图例区分节点、角色、实例、设备或统计分位数；筛选器仅改变所选序列，不自动生成集群去重汇总。\n\n时间口径\n使用源监控的有效时延直方图窗口；A3 约 60 秒，DCU 沿用有效窗口与 rank 去重。 当前看板默认最近 1 小时、15 秒刷新；X 轴为时间。刷新间隔与统计窗口是不同概念。\n\n零值与空白\n缺样、过期或有效性检查不通过时留空。No data 不等于零；正常有效的零值才表示测得为零。 派生指标须满足 monitoring_chart_valid=1；原始数值存在但标记无效时也不显示。"
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "TimeSeriesChart",
            "spec": {
              "legend": {
                "position": "bottom",
                "mode": "list"
              },
              "yAxis": {
                "label": "秒",
                "min": 0
              },
              "visual": {
                "display": "line",
                "lineWidth": 1,
                "connectNulls": false
              },
              "tooltip": {
                "enablePinning": true
              }
            }
          },
          "queries": [
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": "(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.ttft.p50\"} and (monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.ttft.p50\"} == 1) and (min_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.ttft.p50\"}[$__interval]) == 1) and (count_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.ttft.p50\"}[$__interval]) >= ($__interval / 5)) and (time() - timestamp(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.ttft.p50\"}) < 15)) * 1",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{path}}",
                    "minStep": "5s"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": "(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.ttft.p95\"} and (monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.ttft.p95\"} == 1) and (min_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.ttft.p95\"}[$__interval]) == 1) and (count_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.ttft.p95\"}[$__interval]) >= ($__interval / 5)) and (time() - timestamp(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.ttft.p95\"}) < 15)) * 1",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{path}}",
                    "minStep": "5s"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": "(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.ttft.p99\"} and (monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.ttft.p99\"} == 1) and (min_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.ttft.p99\"}[$__interval]) == 1) and (count_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.ttft.p99\"}[$__interval]) >= ($__interval / 5)) and (time() - timestamp(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.ttft.p99\"}) < 15)) * 1",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{path}}",
                    "minStep": "5s"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "p5": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "Token 间延迟 ITL",
            "description": "指标含义\n服务侧相邻输出 Token 间隔的时延分布。它不是整个回答的生成时间；与按整段输出均摊的 TPOT 也可能不同。 P50/P95/P99 是窗口内样本分位数，例如 P95 表示约 95% 的观测不超过该值。分位数来自直方图桶估算，不是精确逐请求排序；不能直接平均多节点的分位数。\n\nY 轴单位\n秒。\n\n曲线与范围\nDCU 环境。图例区分节点、角色、实例、设备或统计分位数；筛选器仅改变所选序列，不自动生成集群去重汇总。\n\n时间口径\n使用源监控的有效时延直方图窗口；A3 约 60 秒，DCU 沿用有效窗口与 rank 去重。 当前看板默认最近 1 小时、15 秒刷新；X 轴为时间。刷新间隔与统计窗口是不同概念。\n\n零值与空白\n缺样、过期或有效性检查不通过时留空。No data 不等于零；正常有效的零值才表示测得为零。 派生指标须满足 monitoring_chart_valid=1；原始数值存在但标记无效时也不显示。"
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "TimeSeriesChart",
            "spec": {
              "legend": {
                "position": "bottom",
                "mode": "list"
              },
              "yAxis": {
                "label": "秒",
                "min": 0
              },
              "visual": {
                "display": "line",
                "lineWidth": 1,
                "connectNulls": false
              },
              "tooltip": {
                "enablePinning": true
              }
            }
          },
          "queries": [
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": "(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.itl.p50\"} and (monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.itl.p50\"} == 1) and (min_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.itl.p50\"}[$__interval]) == 1) and (count_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.itl.p50\"}[$__interval]) >= ($__interval / 5)) and (time() - timestamp(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.itl.p50\"}) < 15)) * 1",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{path}}",
                    "minStep": "5s"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": "(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.itl.p95\"} and (monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.itl.p95\"} == 1) and (min_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.itl.p95\"}[$__interval]) == 1) and (count_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.itl.p95\"}[$__interval]) >= ($__interval / 5)) and (time() - timestamp(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.itl.p95\"}) < 15)) * 1",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{path}}",
                    "minStep": "5s"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": "(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.itl.p99\"} and (monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.itl.p99\"} == 1) and (min_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.itl.p99\"}[$__interval]) == 1) and (count_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.itl.p99\"}[$__interval]) >= ($__interval / 5)) and (time() - timestamp(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.itl.p99\"}) < 15)) * 1",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{path}}",
                    "minStep": "5s"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "p6": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "端到端延迟 E2E",
            "description": "指标含义\n服务侧请求从开始到结束的总时延。不同输入/输出长度、缓存状态和并发负载会改变分布；不能把不同阶段的 P95 相减来求网关开销。 P50/P95/P99 是窗口内样本分位数，例如 P95 表示约 95% 的观测不超过该值。分位数来自直方图桶估算，不是精确逐请求排序；不能直接平均多节点的分位数。\n\nY 轴单位\n秒。\n\n曲线与范围\nDCU 环境。图例区分节点、角色、实例、设备或统计分位数；筛选器仅改变所选序列，不自动生成集群去重汇总。\n\n时间口径\n使用源监控的有效时延直方图窗口；A3 约 60 秒，DCU 沿用有效窗口与 rank 去重。 当前看板默认最近 1 小时、15 秒刷新；X 轴为时间。刷新间隔与统计窗口是不同概念。\n\n零值与空白\n缺样、过期或有效性检查不通过时留空。No data 不等于零；正常有效的零值才表示测得为零。 派生指标须满足 monitoring_chart_valid=1；原始数值存在但标记无效时也不显示。"
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "TimeSeriesChart",
            "spec": {
              "legend": {
                "position": "bottom",
                "mode": "list"
              },
              "yAxis": {
                "label": "秒",
                "min": 0
              },
              "visual": {
                "display": "line",
                "lineWidth": 1,
                "connectNulls": false
              },
              "tooltip": {
                "enablePinning": true
              }
            }
          },
          "queries": [
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": "(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.e2e.p50\"} and (monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.e2e.p50\"} == 1) and (min_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.e2e.p50\"}[$__interval]) == 1) and (count_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.e2e.p50\"}[$__interval]) >= ($__interval / 5)) and (time() - timestamp(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.e2e.p50\"}) < 15)) * 1",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{path}}",
                    "minStep": "5s"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": "(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.e2e.p95\"} and (monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.e2e.p95\"} == 1) and (min_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.e2e.p95\"}[$__interval]) == 1) and (count_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.e2e.p95\"}[$__interval]) >= ($__interval / 5)) and (time() - timestamp(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.e2e.p95\"}) < 15)) * 1",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{path}}",
                    "minStep": "5s"
                  }
                }
              }
